================================================================================
1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
================================================================================

AutoLux is a full-featured online car rental management system built with 
Laravel. It allows customers to browse available vehicles, make bookings, 
upload verification documents, and track their rental history. Administrators 
can manage the vehicle fleet, approve/reject bookings, verify customer 
documents, schedule vehicle maintenance, and generate business reports.

Key Features:
  - Role-based access control (Admin & Customer)
  - Vehicle fleet management with multi-image support
  - Online booking with date-based availability checking
  - Razorpay payment gateway integration
  - Document upload and verification (KYC)
  - Vehicle maintenance scheduling and tracking
  - Business reports and analytics dashboard
  - Real-time notification system
  - Responsive design with modern UI
  - Password reset via email


================================================================================
2. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE
================================================================================

The project follows the standard Laravel MVC pattern:

    +-------------------+
    |    Browser/User   |
    +--------+----------+
             |
    +--------v----------+
    |   Routes (web.php)|
    +--------+----------+
             |
    +--------v----------+
    |    Middleware      |
    |  (Auth, Admin,    |
    |   Customer)       |
    +--------+----------+
             |
    +--------v----------+
    |   Controllers     |
    +--------+----------+
             |
    +--------v----------+
    |   Models (Eloquent)|
    +--------+----------+
             |
    +--------v----------+
    |  MySQL Database   |
    +-------------------+

    Views: Blade Templates (resources/views/)
    Layout: Master layout (layouts/app.blade.php)

Directory Structure:
    app/
      Http/
        Controllers/
          Auth/           -> Authentication controllers
          Admin/          -> Admin panel controllers
          Customer/       -> Customer panel controllers
          HomeController.php
          VehicleController.php
          BookingController.php
          NotificationController.php
        Middleware/
          AdminMiddleware.php
          CustomerMiddleware.php
      Models/
        User.php
        Car.php
        CarImage.php
        Booking.php
        Payment.php
        Document.php
        MaintenanceRecord.php
    resources/views/
      layouts/app.blade.php
      welcome.blade.php
      home.blade.php
      auth/
      cars/
      bookings/
      admin/
      customer/
    database/migrations/
    routes/web.php


================================================================================
3. MODULE 1 - AUTHENTICATION MODULE
================================================================================

Purpose:
  Handles user registration, login, logout, and password reset functionality.
  Supports two roles: 'admin' and 'customer'.

Controllers:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | Auth/LoginController.php                    | Login form display, login/logout |
  | Auth/RegisterController.php                 | Registration form & processing   |
  | Auth/ForgotPasswordController.php           | Password reset via email         |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Views:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | auth/login.blade.php                        | Login page                       |
  | auth/register.blade.php                     | Registration page                |
  | auth/forgot-password.blade.php              | Forgot password page             |
  | auth/reset-password.blade.php               | Reset password page              |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Middleware:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | AdminMiddleware.php                         | Restricts access to admin users  |
  | CustomerMiddleware.php                      | Restricts access to customers    |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Routes:
  GET  /login              -> Show login form
  POST /login              -> Process login
  POST /logout             -> Logout user
  GET  /register           -> Show registration form
  POST /register           -> Process registration
  GET  /forgot-password    -> Show forgot password form
  POST /forgot-password    -> Send reset link email
  GET  /reset-password/{token} -> Show reset password form
  POST /reset-password     -> Process password reset

Features:
  - Email-based login authentication
  - Automatic role assignment (default: customer)
  - Password hashing using Laravel's built-in bcrypt
  - Remember me token support
  - Guest middleware (prevents logged-in users from seeing login/register)
  - Email-based password reset with token verification


