5. MODULE 3 - CAR / VEHICLE MANAGEMENT MODULE
================================================================================

Purpose:
  Complete vehicle fleet management. Public users can browse and view car 
  details. Admins can perform full CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) 
  operations on the vehicle inventory.

Models:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | Car.php                                     | Car entity with attributes       |
  | CarImage.php                                | Car gallery images               |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Controllers:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | VehicleController.php                       | Public car listing & detail view |
  | Admin/CarController.php                     | Admin CRUD for cars              |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Views (Public):
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | cars/index.blade.php                        | Public car listing with filters  |
  | cars/show.blade.php                         | Car detail page with gallery     |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Views (Admin):
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | admin/cars/index.blade.php                  | Admin car listing table          |
  | admin/cars/create.blade.php                 | Add new car form                 |
  | admin/cars/edit.blade.php                   | Edit car form                    |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Database Table - cars:
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Description                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | BIGINT (PK)       | Auto-increment primary key    |
  | brand                   | VARCHAR(100)      | Car brand (e.g., Toyota)      |
  | model                   | VARCHAR(100)      | Car model (e.g., Camry)       |
  | year                    | YEAR              | Manufacturing year            |
  | registration_number     | VARCHAR(20) UQ    | Unique registration plate     |
  | fuel_type               | ENUM              | Petrol/Diesel/Electric/       |
  |                         |                   | Hybrid/CNG                    |
  | transmission            | ENUM              | Manual/Automatic              |
  | seating_capacity        | TINYINT           | Number of seats (default: 5)  |
  | rental_price_per_day    | DECIMAL(10,2)     | Daily rental price in INR     |
  | description             | TEXT              | Car description               |
  | features                | JSON              | Feature list as JSON array    |
  | status                  | ENUM              | Available/Booked/Rented/      |
  |                         |                   | Maintenance                   |
  | thumbnail               | VARCHAR           | Thumbnail image path          |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Record creation time          |
  | updated_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Last update time              |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Database Table - car_images:
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Description                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | BIGINT (PK)       | Auto-increment primary key    |
  | car_id                  | BIGINT (FK)       | References cars.id            |
  | image_path              | VARCHAR           | Image file path               |
  | sort_order              | INT               | Display order (default: 0)    |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Record creation time          |
  | updated_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Last update time              |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Routes (Public):
  GET /cars           -> Browse all available cars
  GET /cars/{id}      -> View car details

Routes (Admin):
  GET    /admin/cars          -> List all cars
  GET    /admin/cars/create   -> Show create car form
  POST   /admin/cars          -> Store new car
  GET    /admin/cars/{id}/edit -> Show edit car form
  PUT    /admin/cars/{id}     -> Update car
  DELETE /admin/cars/{id}     -> Delete car

Key Methods in Car Model:
  - isAvailableForDates($pickup, $return) : Check date-based availability
  - scopeAvailable($query)               : Filter only available cars
  - scopeByBrand($query, $brand)         : Filter by brand
  - scopeByFuelType($query, $fuelType)   : Filter by fuel type
  - scopeByTransmission($query, $type)   : Filter by transmission
  - scopeByPriceRange($query, $min, $max): Filter by price range
  - getFormattedPriceAttribute()          : Returns price as "₹X,XXX"
  - getDisplayNameAttribute()             : Returns "Brand Model (Year)"


================================================================================
6. MODULE 4 - BOOKING MANAGEMENT MODULE
================================================================================

Purpose:
  Manages the entire car booking lifecycle from creation to completion or 
  cancellation. Customers create bookings, and admins manage booking statuses.

Model:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | Booking.php                                 | Booking entity with lifecycle    |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Controllers:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | BookingController.php                       | Customer booking operations      |
  | Admin/BookingController.php                 | Admin booking management         |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Views (Customer):
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | bookings/index.blade.php                    | My bookings list                 |
  | bookings/create.blade.php                   | Create new booking form          |
  | bookings/show.blade.php                     | Booking detail view              |
  | bookings/success.blade.php                  | Booking success confirmation     |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Views (Admin):
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | admin/bookings/index.blade.php              | All bookings management table    |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Database Table - bookings:
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Description                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | BIGINT (PK)       | Auto-increment primary key    |
  | booking_number          | VARCHAR(20) UQ    | Auto-generated (BK-XXXXXXXX) |
  | user_id                 | BIGINT (FK)       | References users.id           |
  | car_id                  | BIGINT (FK)       | References cars.id            |
  | pickup_date             | DATE              | Rental start date             |
  | return_date             | DATE              | Rental end date               |
  | total_amount            | DECIMAL(10,2)     | Total rental cost in INR      |
  | security_deposit        | DECIMAL(10,2)     | Security deposit (default: 0) |
  | status                  | ENUM              | Pending/Confirmed/Active/     |
  |                         |                   | Completed/Cancelled           |
  | pickup_location         | TEXT              | Pickup address                |
  | return_location         | TEXT              | Return address                |
  | notes                   | TEXT              | Additional notes              |
  | cancelled_at            | TIMESTAMP         | Cancellation timestamp        |
  | cancellation_reason     | TEXT              | Reason for cancellation       |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Record creation time          |
  | updated_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Last update time              |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Routes (Customer):
  GET  /customer/bookings/create/{carId}  -> Show booking form for a car
  POST /customer/bookings                 -> Store new booking
  GET  /customer/bookings                 -> List my bookings

Routes (Shared Authenticated):
  GET  /bookings/{id}/success  -> Booking success page
  GET  /bookings/{id}          -> View booking details
  POST /bookings/{id}/cancel   -> Cancel a booking

Routes (Admin):
  GET  /admin/bookings              -> View all bookings
  POST /admin/bookings/{id}/status  -> Update booking status

Booking Status Lifecycle:
  Pending -> Confirmed -> Active -> Completed
       \                                
        +-> Cancelled

Key Methods in Booking Model:
  - Auto-generates booking_number on creation (BK-XXXXXXXX)
  - canBeCancelled()            : True if status is Pending/Confirmed AND 
                                  24+ hours before pickup
  - getRentalDaysAttribute()    : Calculates number of rental days
  - getFormattedTotalAttribute(): Returns "₹X,XXX.XX" format
  - getStatusBadgeAttribute()   : Returns CSS class for status badge


================================================================================
7. MODULE 5 - PAYMENT MODULE
================================================================================

Purpose:
  Handles payment processing for bookings using Razorpay payment gateway.
  Tracks transaction details, payment status, and refunds.

Model:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | Payment.php                                 | Payment transaction entity       |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Database Table - payments:
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Description                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | BIGINT (PK)       | Auto-increment primary key    |
  | transaction_id          | VARCHAR(50) UQ    | Auto-generated (TXN-XXXX...) |
  | booking_id              | BIGINT (FK)       | References bookings.id        |
  | user_id                 | BIGINT (FK)       | References users.id           |
  | amount                  | DECIMAL(10,2)     | Payment amount in INR         |
  | currency                | VARCHAR(3)        | Currency code (default: INR)  |
  | status                  | ENUM              | Pending/Success/Failed/       |
  |                         |                   | Refunded                      |
  | razorpay_order_id       | VARCHAR           | Razorpay order identifier     |
  | razorpay_payment_id     | VARCHAR           | Razorpay payment identifier   |
  | razorpay_signature      | VARCHAR           | Razorpay signature for verify |
  | method                  | VARCHAR(50)       | Payment method (UPI/Card/etc) |
  | metadata                | JSON              | Additional payment metadata   |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Record creation time          |
  | updated_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Last update time              |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Payment Status Flow:
  Pending -> Success
       \-> Failed
  Success -> Refunded

Key Methods in Payment Model:
  - Auto-generates transaction_id on creation (TXN-XXXXXXXXXXXX)
  - isSuccessful()                 : Returns true if status is 'Success'
  - getFormattedAmountAttribute()  : Returns "₹X,XXX.XX" format
  - getStatusBadgeAttribute()      : Returns CSS class for status badge


================================================================================
8. MODULE 6 - DOCUMENT VERIFICATION MODULE
================================================================================

Purpose:
  Manages KYC (Know Your Customer) document uploads by customers and 
  verification/approval by admins. Customers must upload identity documents
  before they can rent vehicles.

Model:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | Document.php                                | Document entity                  |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Controllers:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | Customer/DocumentController.php             | Customer document upload         |
  | Admin/DocumentController.php                | Admin document verification      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Views:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | customer/documents/index.blade.php          | Customer document upload page    |
  | admin/documents/index.blade.php             | Admin document review page       |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Database Table - documents:
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Description                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | BIGINT (PK)       | Auto-increment primary key    |
  | user_id                 | BIGINT (FK)       | References users.id           |
  | type                    | ENUM              | Driving License/Aadhaar Card/ |
  |                         |                   | PAN Card                      |
  | file_path               | VARCHAR           | Stored file path              |
  | file_name               | VARCHAR           | Original file name            |
  | status                  | ENUM              | Pending/Approved/Rejected     |
  | rejection_reason        | TEXT              | Reason if rejected            |
  | verified_by             | BIGINT (FK)       | Admin who verified (users.id) |
  | verified_at             | TIMESTAMP         | Verification timestamp        |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Record creation time          |
  | updated_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Last update time              |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Routes (Customer):
  GET  /customer/documents   -> View my documents
  POST /customer/documents   -> Upload a document

Routes (Admin):
  GET  /admin/documents             -> View all pending documents
  POST /admin/documents/{id}/approve -> Approve a document
  POST /admin/documents/{id}/reject  -> Reject a document

Supported Document Types:
  1. Driving License
  2. Aadhaar Card
  3. PAN Card

Document Verification Flow:
  Customer Uploads -> Pending -> Admin Reviews -> Approved / Rejected

Key Methods in Document Model:
  - isApproved()               : Returns true if status is 'Approved'
  - isPending()                : Returns true if status is 'Pending'
  - getStatusBadgeAttribute()  : Returns CSS class for status badge
  - verifier() relationship    : Links to the admin who verified


