11. MODULE 9 - NOTIFICATIONS MODULE
================================================================================

Purpose:
  Provides in-app notifications for users about booking updates, document 
  verification status, and other important events.

Controller:
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | File                                        | Description                      |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+
  | NotificationController.php                  | Mark notifications as read       |
  +---------------------------------------------+----------------------------------+

Database Table - notifications (Laravel default):
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Description                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | UUID (PK)         | UUID primary key              |
  | type                    | VARCHAR           | Notification class type       |
  | notifiable_type         | VARCHAR           | Polymorphic type (User)       |
  | notifiable_id           | BIGINT            | Polymorphic ID (user_id)      |
  | data                    | TEXT              | JSON notification data        |
  | read_at                 | TIMESTAMP         | When notification was read    |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Record creation time          |
  | updated_at              | TIMESTAMP         | Last update time              |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Routes:
  POST /notifications/{id}/read   -> Mark single notification as read
  POST /notifications/read-all    -> Mark all notifications as read

Features:
  - Real-time notification bell in navigation
  - Polymorphic notification system (Laravel Notifiable trait)
  - Read/unread status tracking
  - Bulk mark-all-as-read functionality


