14. DATABASE SCHEMA (DATA DICTIONARY)
================================================================================

Total Database Tables: 9
  1. users
  2. password_reset_tokens
  3. sessions
  4. cache / cache_locks
  5. jobs / job_batches / failed_jobs
  6. cars
  7. car_images
  8. bookings
  9. payments
  10. documents
  11. maintenance_records
  12. notifications

Table: users
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Constraints                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | BIGINT UNSIGNED   | PRIMARY KEY, AUTO_INCREMENT   |
  | name                    | VARCHAR(255)      | NOT NULL                      |
  | email                   | VARCHAR(255)      | NOT NULL, UNIQUE              |
  | phone                   | VARCHAR(15)       | NULLABLE                      |
  | address                 | TEXT              | NULLABLE                      |
  | city                    | VARCHAR(100)      | NULLABLE                      |
  | state                   | VARCHAR(100)      | NULLABLE                      |
  | pincode                 | VARCHAR(10)       | NULLABLE                      |
  | avatar                  | VARCHAR(255)      | NULLABLE                      |
  | role                    | ENUM(customer,    | DEFAULT 'customer'            |
  |                         |      admin)       |                               |
  | email_verified_at       | TIMESTAMP         | NULLABLE                      |
  | password                | VARCHAR(255)      | NOT NULL                      |
  | remember_token          | VARCHAR(100)      | NULLABLE                      |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | NULLABLE                      |
  | updated_at              | TIMESTAMP         | NULLABLE                      |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Table: password_reset_tokens
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Constraints                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | email                   | VARCHAR(255)      | PRIMARY KEY                   |
  | token                   | VARCHAR(255)      | NOT NULL                      |
  | created_at              | TIMESTAMP         | NULLABLE                      |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+

Table: sessions
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | Column                  | Type              | Constraints                   |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+
  | id                      | VARCHAR(255)      | PRIMARY KEY                   |
  | user_id                 | BIGINT UNSIGNED   | NULLABLE, INDEXED, FK->users  |
  | ip_address              | VARCHAR(45)       | NULLABLE                      |
  | user_agent              | TEXT              | NULLABLE                      |
  | payload                 | LONGTEXT          | NOT NULL                      |
  | last_activity           | INTEGER           | NOT NULL, INDEXED             |
  +-------------------------+-------------------+-------------------------------+


================================================================================
15. ROUTE SUMMARY
================================================================================

TOTAL ROUTES: 30+

PUBLIC ROUTES (No authentication required):
  +------+-----------------------------+----------------------------+
  | HTTP | URI                         | Name                       |
  +------+-----------------------------+----------------------------+
  | GET  | /                           | home                       |
