================================================================================
16. MIDDLEWARE DETAILS
================================================================================

1. AdminMiddleware (AdminMiddleware.php):
   - Checks if authenticated user has role = 'admin'
   - Redirects unauthorized users away from admin routes
   - Applied to all /admin/* routes

2. CustomerMiddleware (CustomerMiddleware.php):
   - Checks if authenticated user has role = 'customer'
   - Redirects unauthorized users away from customer routes
   - Applied to all /customer/* routes

3. Built-in Laravel Middleware:
   - auth       : Ensures user is logged in
   - guest      : Ensures user is NOT logged in (for login/register pages)


