  Booking (N) --> (1) User
  Booking (N) --> (1) Car

  Payment (N) --> (1) Booking
  Payment (N) --> (1) User

  Document (N) --> (1) User (uploader)
  Document (N) --> (1) User (verifier / verified_by)

  MaintenanceRecord (N) --> (1) Car

